{"Working-hours end time uses the slot start time instead of the slot end - both `start` and `end` derive from `slotStartTime`, so the bounds check only considers the slot's start and ignores its duration. `end` should be computed from `slotEndTime` to ensure the entire slot lies within working hours": 0.9834703803062439, "In `checkIfIsAvailable`, the date override logic `.find` callback mutates `dateOverrideExist`, has code paths that don't return a boolean, and uses `===` on Dayjs instances instead of `isSame`, leading to subtle bugs and unclear control flow": 0.9789314866065979, "The sign and use of utcOffset may be reversed - computing the organizer offset then inverting it before adding subtracts the organizer's offset instead of applying it, which could cause off-by-one-day timezone issues": 0.835582971572876}